# lsCyc

- _lsCyc(α)_ ⟹ _lsSeq(α, Infinity)_

Infinite _lsSeq_.

```
>>> lsCyc([lsGeom(1, 3, 3), -1]).next(8)
[1 3 9 -1 1 3 9 -1]
```

* * *

See also: lsGeom, lsSeq

